WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.458
That is when I realized,

00:00:02.458 --> 00:00:05.770
my phone was sending messages from the future.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.600
Do not leave the house at 7:30.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.280
The clock said 7:27.

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:14.150
Then: you have two minutes.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.666
Outside, everything looked normal.

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:21.780
Then the phone vibrated: Look behind you.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:26.635
Silence. Nobody was there. I typed: Who are you?

00:00:26.635 --> 00:00:31.341
Before I could send it, a reply appeared: You.

00:00:31.491 --> 00:00:34.119
A video file popped up in the chat,

00:00:34.119 --> 00:00:37.331
timestamped tomorrow at 7:30 PM.

00:00:37.481 --> 00:00:39.713
I watched myself enter the room,

00:00:39.713 --> 00:00:42.441
and stare straight into the camera.

00:00:42.591 --> 00:00:44.479
If you are watching this,

00:00:44.479 --> 00:00:47.311
you have already made the wrong choice.
